#: ../../citing.rst:2
msgid "Citing PyHermes"
msgstr "引用 PyHermes"

#: ../../citing.rst:4
msgid ""
"If PyHermes contributes to a publication, presentation, or released data "
"product, please cite the software version used. GitHub and compatible "
"reference managers can read the repository's ``CITATION.cff`` file "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"如果 PyHermes 对论文、报告或已发布的数据产品有所贡献，请引用实际使用的软件版本。"
"GitHub 及兼容的文献管理软件可以直接读取仓库中的 ``CITATION.cff`` 文件。"

#: ../../citing.rst:9
msgid "Software citation"
msgstr "软件引用"

#: ../../citing.rst:11
msgid ""
"Until the accompanying paper is available, the following software "
"citation can be used:"
msgstr "在配套论文正式发表前，可以使用下面的软件引用："

#: ../../citing.rst:25
msgid "Paper citation placeholder"
msgstr "论文引用占位示例"

#: ../../citing.rst:29
msgid ""
"The entry below is a visible placeholder, not a published-paper citation."
" Replace the author list, title, journal, year, and identifier before the"
" repository becomes public and the manuscript is announced."
msgstr ""
"下面的条目是明确标注的占位内容，并非已发表论文的正式引用。在仓库公开并宣布论文"
"之前，必须替换作者列表、标题、期刊、年份和文献标识符。"

#: ../../citing.rst:43
msgid ""
"Please also cite the scientific datasets, simulations, and external "
"methods used in a particular analysis. A PyHermes citation does not "
"replace those method-specific references."
msgstr ""
"还请引用具体分析中使用的科学数据集、模拟和外部方法。引用 PyHermes 不能替代这些"
"与方法相关的参考文献。"
